    "Restored missing serial value field 'label' for all entries in serial_channels[0].values; no other functional changes are made.",
    "Board arduino:avr:uno and authoritative wiring are preserved: LM35 on A1; buttons on D2/D3/D4; buzzer D6; TM1637 CLK=D7 and DIO=D5; LED D13.",
    "No active-high polarity or pullup info for buttons is provided; digital_input requests are created without active_high/pullup so catalog defaults apply, and the model uses pressed= true without double-inverting.",
