    "LM35 conversion to degC and any calibration are handled in the SysML model; no explicit scale/offset is configured in analog_input.",
    "Serial reporting cadence, field contents beyond the typed values, and any fixed-text messages (if needed) are handled in the SysML model; no serial_text_output is added here because the requirements only state '串口输出完整流程日志' without fixed message text."
