    "original_requirement": "设计一个三阶段烹饪辅助系统，使用温度传感器 LM35（A1）、按钮 D2、D3、D4、蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和 LED D13。系统支持预热、烹饪、保温三个阶段，每个阶段可设置目标温度和持续时间；温度达到目标时蜂鸣提示，阶段结束自动切换。数码管显示当前阶段编号和剩余时间，串口输出完整流程日志。",
    "effective_requirement": "设计一个三阶段烹饪辅助系统，使用温度传感器 LM35（A1）、按钮 D2、D3、D4、蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D7，DIO=D5）和 LED D13。系统支持预热、烹饪、保温三个阶段，每个阶段可设置目标温度和持续时间；温度达到目标时蜂鸣提示，阶段结束自动切换。数码管显示当前阶段编号和剩余时间，串口输出完整流程日志。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A1\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D4\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D7\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
